00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:43.180
Council chair Justin Cain called the threat of a spill to Fraser River Salmon, fishing rights and

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:47.680
their way of being heinous. Cain said the project was approved without an impact assessment,

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:50.720
and without consultation with the statin-magnation as a whole.

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:56.640
That council represents 11 communities and says the proposal means more than 500 river crossings,

00:01:56.940 --> 00:02:01.040
